{"id":"4020879240011017038","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"演唱會造型是朋友推薦的SHEIN兩百塊假髮 好自然美麗▓","username":"1zhennn","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@1zhennn/post/DfNCF2BmWtO","timestamp":"2026-11-01T15:16:19Z","media_type":"IMAGE","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-01T23:01:11.880659307Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-01T23:01:38.434813Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-01T23:01:38.434813Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_be59e862497e9acd","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4020902067385078197","query":"演唱会","source_queries":["演唱会"],"text":"哎。编辑了好多话，但感觉还是词不达意。\n这个账号其实有将近一半的浏览者是来自台湾(我也不太懂脆的推送机制🫠可能是因为刚开始玩的时候和很多台湾米互关了?)在河道里飘的也是繁中的帖子会更多。\n不管是大陆还是台湾，作为粉丝的出发点都是一样的，爱他们的心也是一样的。并没有谁比谁爱得更多、爱得更高尚。他们是时隔八年一起回到台湾，可上一次他们在大陆的演唱会已经是十年前了。我相信你们能理解这种多年未见、久别重逢的心情吧。\n由于种种现实因素，其实很多大陆米能选择的场次也十分有限（猪肝红办签证确实挺艰难的、甚至有些因为工作不能出境出国）作为绝大部分大陆米都能选择的场次，香港的官方语言是粤语，可很多来自内陆地区的人是不太能听懂的。羡慕台湾场，这很正常。可台湾大概是这个地球上普通大陆人最难去的地方了。\n可能是因为生活环境的差异。作为在一个相对民主的环境里生活的你们，可能想象不到长期失权的环境，其实根本不会考虑那些离我们很遥远的政治问题。不否认在哪里都会有极端的人，但大部分民众关心的也只是生活过得怎么样。我想得也只会是，如果有机会的话，我想到台湾去看一看，去垦丁骑着车看海。至于两边的关系，这不是我该操心的。","username":"h0p3_agu1st","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@h0p3_agu1st/post/DfNHSBrHxG1","timestamp":"2026-11-01T16:01:40Z","media_type":"TEXT_POST","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱会"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-01T23:01:22.057905968Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-01T23:01:38.434813Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-01T23:01:38.434813Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_0e5c931e94849395","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4020945943922685410","query":"演唱會","source_queries":["演唱會"],"text":"有多兩張『精選造型15 選1』的序號\n明天會先問周圍回歸的朋友有沒有需要，沒有就釋出\n會直接貼序號（貼在留言區），大家請自己拼手速複製貼上，兌換到的那個人再麻煩在序號下方告知「已兌換」，感謝\n\n提醒一下\n🔸1組序號只能兌換1次，無法重複兌換\n🔸1個帳號只能兌換5組不同序號，超過無法再兌換\n❗️不知道序號怎麼兌換的人趕緊先研究一下❗️\n\n這次MAMAMOO和BABYMONSTER演唱會搶票時都沒有搶到😭，希望釋出序號給想收藏造型的人這件事，能讓我以後搶票時都能成功上岸QAQ","username":"ruru_ruruyo","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@ruru_ruruyo/post/DfNRQg4jzXi","timestamp":"2026-11-01T17:28:51Z","media_type":"IMAGE","relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["演唱會"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-01T23:01:11.880625357Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-01T23:01:38.434813Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-01T23:01:38.434813Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_ed7330708e9e1d4d","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
{"id":"4021002445392517873","query":"concert","source_queries":["concert"],"text":"When tickets went on sale for the tour, my bestie of 20+ years texted me asking if I wanted to go see BTS with her. She really wanted to go and needed a concert buddy. I had heard their name but wasn't really familiar with them. However, I'm a huge fan of live music and I knew it meant a lot to her. Little did I know almost 3 months later I'd be ARMY, with my life changed because of these 7 men and their music. I like to say I'm starting my 2.0 as a mom finding herself during their 2.0 💟🫰","username":"andieea_87","permalink":"https://www.threads.com/@andieea_87/post/DfNeGt-mRrx","timestamp":"2026-11-01T19:21:06Z","media_type":"IMAGE","is_reply":true,"relevance_score":60,"relevance_tier":"high","matched_terms":["concert"],"retrieval_sources":["threads_ssr_recent"],"searched_at":"2026-11-01T23:01:32.345336426Z","first_seen_at":"2026-11-01T23:01:38.434813Z","last_seen_at":"2026-11-01T23:01:38.434813Z","seen_count":1,"content_cluster_id":"dup_9b399f04d98a7143","duplicate_group_size":1,"duplicate_reason":"","dedupe_counted":true,"signal_counted":true,"clean_exclusion_reason":""}
